hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2866","**\nNarrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, narrated to us Yahya ibn Sa‘id, narrated to us Thawr, on the authority of Rāshid ibn Sa‘d, on the authority of ‘Abdullāh ibn Luhayy, on the authority of ‘Abdullāh ibn Qurt (RA) who said:\nThe Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) said, “The greatest day with Allāh is the Day of Sacrifice (Yawm an-Naḥr), then the Day of Rest (Yawm al-Qarr).”\nAbū Bakr (RA) said: “Yawm al-Qarr means the second day after the Day of Sacrifice.”"
